    "body": "Hi, thanks for your question!\n\nWe’ve already implemented an optimization method for the parameters of quantum circuits. You can find more details in the documentation here:\nhttps://squlearn.github.io/user_guide/kernel_methods.html#training-of-quantum-kernels\n\nThis functionality is provided through the KernelOptimizer class, which wraps around the ProjectedKernel and can be used with all kernel-based methods.\n\nIf you’d like to optimize the hyperparameters of the ProjectedKernel (such as the gamma parameter), please refer to the following tutorial:\nhttps://squlearn.github.io/examples/example_kernel_grid_search.html\n\nLet us know if you have any further questions.",
